# Scoped deliberately to the native lane's own paths.
#
# Purpose: keep SQL and docs LF so the §13 sha256 verification in
# db/migrations/README.md reproduces on a clone from any platform, and so the
# migrations reach Postgres byte-identical to the guide they were extracted from.
#
# NOT repo-wide on purpose. A `* text=auto` rule here would renormalise files
# owned by the front-end and platform lanes and hand them a spurious whole-repo
# diff on their next checkout. If the team wants repo-wide normalisation it
# should be one deliberate commit, not a side effect of this branch.
db/**          text eol=lf
docs/native/** text eol=lf
docs/adr/**    text eol=lf
